# Metro Garage Solutions — Project SEO

## Stack

- **Next.js 15.0.3** + **React 19 RC** — App Router, JavaScript (no TypeScript)
- **Single-page app** with hash sections: `#about`, `#services`, `#works`, `#contact`
- **Domain:** `https://metrogaragesolutions.com`

---

## Key Files

| Purpose | File |
|---------|------|
| Root metadata + layout | `src/app/layout.js` |
| JSON-LD structured data | `src/app/components/StructuredData.jsx` |
| Sitemap | `src/app/sitemap.js` |
| Global styles | `src/app/globals.css` |

---

## What's Already Implemented

- `metadataBase`, OG tags, Twitter Card, robots, icons, manifest — all in `src/app/layout.js`
- 5 JSON-LD schemas in `StructuredData.jsx`: `LocalBusiness`, `Service`, `Organization`, `BreadcrumbList`, `FAQPage`
- Google Analytics via `@next/third-parties/google` — production-only, gated on `NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_TRACKING_ID`
- Fonts via `next/font/google`: Montserrat, Comfortaa, Rubik — no render-blocking `@import`

**Do not duplicate** any of the above. When editing metadata, always read `layout.js` first and modify in place.

---

## Project Conventions

**JavaScript, not TypeScript.** Use `.js` / `.jsx` extensions and plain JS objects — no `import type`, no type annotations.

**Metadata is a flat string title**, not a template:
```js
// Current
title: "Metro Garage Solutions | Professional Garage Door Services in Rockville MD"

// If adding sub-pages in future, switch to:
title: { template: '%s | Metro Garage Solutions', default: 'Metro Garage Solutions | ...' }
```

**JSON-LD injection uses `next/script` with unique string ids:**
```jsx
import Script from 'next/script';

<Script
  id="schema-your-type"          // must be unique across all Script tags
  type="application/ld+json"
  dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: JSON.stringify(schema) }}
/>
```
Add new schemas inside `StructuredData.jsx` — don't scatter them across components.

**`@id` anchors** — cross-reference schemas using the established anchors:
- `"https://metrogaragesolutions.com/#business"` → LocalBusiness
- `"https://metrogaragesolutions.com/#organization"` → Organization
- `"https://metrogaragesolutions.com/#services"` → Service

